        "late": "Noir Corne and Cardigan take central three-block duties. Kroos reduces Beagle's outer queue; fresh Plume replaces Spot after its early paired wave. Steward later returns facing UP at [2,5] for central armor clearance.",
        "final_release": "After hostile clearance, both arts slots transfer to western clearers. Both civilians must independently reach their objectives."
